# Trained model — 39 MB, regenerate with `python tbt_model.py train <csv> --fast`
# Keeping binaries out of git is deliberate: the model is a build artifact, it
# changes on every monthly retrain, and it would bloat history fast. If you want
# it versioned, use Git LFS or push it to blob storage and record the hash.
*.joblib

# Data — the archive contains customer names and pricing. Do not commit it.
*.csv
!sample_input.csv

# Generated outputs
audit*.xlsx
scored*.xlsx
*.log

